      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そのための努力もたくさんしています。\r\n焦っているところはあるかもしれません。",
        "official_en": "It’s true that he makes the occasional misstep, but I can’t stress enough how hard he works to live up to his words.",
        "real_en": "He’s worked incredibly hard for it, too. He may be a little impatient, though."
      },
