        "official_en_sha256": "16191d603215e9024e9b5419849902219bf9f66d683a66405b5d87574f79fe40"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、私は信じているんです。\r\nエルは守り人の使命を立派に果たすと。",
        "official_en": "I have complete confidence that he’ll see his duty as a Warden through successfully.",
        "real_en": null
