        "official_en_sha256": "9e26b5531c26425d9f6f6e429c3d7933ee9252ab8f0be3217695f4d8ab7c57f1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "アルシャ、いいんだ。\r\n命令を聞かずに飛び出した俺が悪い。",
        "official_en": "Arsha, it’s fine. I was the one who ignored his orders and ran off.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
