        "official_en_sha256": "e46c3846ec9eb4d1b594b0e0a095c23d93d2b07d4faf66acebaab5743a6ee0bd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "エル、よく戦いました。\r\nアルシャも守れてよかった。",
        "official_en": "El. You fought well, and I am glad you were able to protect Arsha.",
        "real_en": null
      },
