        "official_en_sha256": "0fecbcce30502c862114164419284e92d7bf76968fc3feb885e0cdc2ed01219c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "エルはずっと私に言っているんです。\r\n今はまだ力が足りないけれど、\r\nいつか守り人に相応しい者になってみせると。",
        "official_en": "El always tells me that—though he may not be strong enough yet—he’ll be worthy of the title “Warden” one day.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
